{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-0r.ancient": "又一个从别的故事里走出来的家伙。你是谁？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-1r.char": "巡逻骑士。月圆之夜还没结束，城镇还等着我回去。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-2r.ancient": "那就回去吧，小红帽。别让狼等太久。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-0r.ancient": "又是你。你的外婆还好吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-1r.char": "她让我捎句话：别挡路。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-2r.ancient": "……好一个外婆。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-0r.ancient": "你的誓言，比这座塔还要顽固。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-1r.char": "以月光起誓——我从不食言。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-2r.ancient": "那就看看，月光能照到多高。"
}
